{
  "number": 2,
  "title": "Pip and the Lost Kitten",
  "lesson": "Being brave doesn't mean you're never scared. It means helping, even when you are.",
  "next": "Next time on Pip and Friends: Hazel thinks her spikes keep everyone away...",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "setting": {
        "place": "burrow",
        "time": "night",
        "rain": true,
        "seed": "storm"
      },
      "chars": {
        "pip": {
          "x": 1280,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "worried",
          "look": "up"
        },
        "mittens": {
          "x": 2250,
          "face": -1,
          "emo": "sad"
        }
      },
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "narrator",
          "text": "One stormy night, the rain went pitter-patter on Pip's little round door.",
          "sfx": ["thunder"],
          "fx": [["flash", 0.2]]
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "Ooh! Thunder! I don't like storms one bit.",
          "cam": "pip",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "gest": "shake"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "wait": 2.0,
          "sfx": ["knock"],
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "surprised",
              "look": "right",
              "gest": "hop"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "Somebody's knocking! Who's there?",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "worried",
              "look": "right"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "Mew... Hello? I'm lost, and I'm so cold.",
          "cam": "mittens",
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "move": [1520],
              "time": 1.4,
              "emo": "sad"
            },
            "pip": {
              "look": "mittens"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "Oh no! A little kitten! You're soaking wet! Come in, come in!",
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "worried",
              "gest": "hug",
              "move": [1360],
              "time": 0.8
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "I'm Mittens. I was chasing a butterfly, and now I can't find my mama.",
          "cam": "mittens",
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "sad",
              "look": "pip"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "wait": 0.6,
          "sfx": ["thunder"],
          "fx": [["flash", 0.0]],
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "gest": "jump"
            },
            "pip": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "gest": "shake"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "Eek! The sky is so loud!",
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "gest": "shake"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "It's okay, Mittens. I'm a little scared too. But do you know what thunder is?",
          "cam": "pip",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "determined",
              "look": "mittens"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "It's just the sky clapping its big hands! Clap, clap, BOOM!",
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "excited",
              "gest": "cheer"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "surprised",
              "look": "pip"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "Hee hee! The sky is clapping!",
          "sfx": ["sparkle"],
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "bounce"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "When the storm is over, I'll help you find your mama. I promise!",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "determined",
              "gest": "point"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "happy"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "setting": {
        "place": "forest",
        "time": "night",
        "seed": "afterstorm"
      },
      "chars": {
        "pip": {
          "x": -200,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "determined"
        },
        "mittens": {
          "x": -420,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "worried"
        },
        "hazel": {
          "x": 1350,
          "face": -1,
          "emo": "neutral"
        }
      },
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "narrator",
          "text": "Soon, the rain stopped, and the fireflies came out to light the way.",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "move": [700],
              "time": 2.4
            },
            "mittens": {
              "move": [500],
              "time": 2.6
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "Mama Cat! Mama Cat! Where are you?",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "gest": "wave",
              "look": "up"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "hazel",
          "text": "Oh prickles! Who's shouting in the dark?",
          "cam": "hazel",
          "sfx": ["pop"],
          "do": {
            "hazel": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "gest": "jump"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "scared",
              "look": "hazel"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "It's just me, Hazel! This is Mittens. She's lost.",
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "point"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "hazel",
          "text": "A lost kitten? Oh, you poor little thing!",
          "do": {
            "hazel": {
              "emo": "worried",
              "look": "mittens"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "hazel",
          "text": "Wait! When I was hiding from the rain, I heard someone calling: Mittens! Mittens! By the pond!",
          "cam": "hazel",
          "do": {
            "hazel": {
              "emo": "excited",
              "gest": "point"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "That's my mama! Let's go! Let's go!",
          "cam": "mittens",
          "sfx": ["chime"],
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "excited",
              "gest": "jump"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "setting": {
        "place": "pond",
        "time": "night",
        "seed": "reunion"
      },
      "chars": {
        "pip": {
          "x": 520,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "determined"
        },
        "hazel": {
          "x": 250,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "neutral"
        },
        "mittens": {
          "x": 760,
          "face": 1,
          "emo": "worried"
        },
        "mama": {
          "x": 2300,
          "face": -1,
          "emo": "worried"
        }
      },
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "mama",
          "text": "Mittens! Mittens! Where are you, my little one?",
          "do": {
            "mama": {
              "move": [1450],
              "time": 2.0,
              "emo": "worried"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "look": "mama",
              "emo": "surprised"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "MAMA!",
          "cam": "mittens",
          "sfx": ["sparkle"],
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "excited",
              "gest": "jump",
              "move": [1180],
              "time": 1.0
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mama",
          "text": "Oh, Mittens! I was looking everywhere for you!",
          "cam": "mama",
          "do": {
            "mama": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "hug"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "hug"
            }
          },
          "fx": [["sparkles", "mittens", 1.4]]
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "Pip kept me safe in the storm, Mama. He told me thunder is the sky clapping!",
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "excited",
              "look": "pip",
              "gest": "point"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mama",
          "text": "Thank you, Pip. That was very brave and very kind.",
          "do": {
            "mama": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "look": "pip",
              "gest": "nod"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "pip",
          "text": "I was scared too. But I could still help!",
          "cam": "pip",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "proud",
              "gest": "shrug"
            },
            "hazel": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "cheer"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "narrator",
          "text": "Being brave doesn't mean you're never scared. It means helping, even when you are.",
          "cam": "wide",
          "do": {
            "pip": {
              "emo": "happy"
            },
            "mittens": {
              "emo": "happy",
              "gest": "bounce"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "mittens",
          "text": "Bye bye, Pip! Bye bye, Hazel! Thank you!",
          "do": {
            "mittens": {
              "gest": "wave",
              "move": [2300],
              "time": 3.0,
              "at": 0.8
            },
            "mama": {
              "gest": "wave",
              "move": [2400],
              "time": 3.0,
              "at": 1.0
            },
            "pip": {
              "gest": "wave"
            },
            "hazel": {
              "gest": "wave"
            }
          },
          "wait": 3.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "setting": {
        "place": "burrow",
        "time": "night",
